|GKB                           EAGLE CLAW
|YK0================================================================

|YKB'To be one with the eagle is to seek great heights and to deal
great pain.'|WK0 - |RKBMaster Maelstrom 
|YK0
The Eagle Claw is a basic attack. The Monk lashes at their
target to deal a short sharp blow. Monks are generally taught
this attack first as a means of self defence.

|CKBThis is an Initiate rank power that is struck by an unarmed
Monk.

